# {{AGENT_NAME}} - RAG Assistant

AI-powered document search and question-answering system for **{{DOMAIN}}** using OpenAI Agents SDK and vector search.

## Overview

This RAG (Retrieval-Augmented Generation) assistant combines:
- **Vector Search**: Semantic search across your document collection
- **OpenAI Agents SDK**: Intelligent conversation handling
- **File Search Tool**: Built-in document retrieval with citations
- **FastAPI**: RESTful API for chat and document management

